    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mewseum: Masterpieces</strong> is a relaxing game where you can solve hundreds of puzzles while revealing unique masterpieces. Unwind to the sound of a beautiful piano with classical music or listen to your own favorite audio while playing. The puzzles range from easy to medium difficulty, ensuring a smooth and frustration-free experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde9How to Play:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is to paint squares and/or rectangles within the grid while following two simple rules:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each painted section must contain exactly one number.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number indicates the exact size of the section you need to paint.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa8<strong>Explore Art History\u2026 with Cats!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417690/extras/bcf2d91ed8419b0d675cea1c618d8aec.poster.avif?t=1752325862\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417690/extras/bcf2d91ed8419b0d675cea1c618d8aec.webm?t=1752325862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover reimagined versions of iconic paintings, where cats take center stage in some of the most famous artworks in history. The featured paintings include:<br>\ud83e\uddaa<i>Girl with a Pearl Earring</i><br>\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83c\udfa8<i>Mona Lisa</i><br>\ud83d\ude40<i>The Scream</i><br>\u2728<i>Starry Night</i><br>\ud83c\udfe1<i>American Gothic</i><br>\ud83e\uddb5<i>Abaporu</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc6b<i>Arnolfini Portrait</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc67\u200d\ud83d\udc67<i>Las Meninas</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae<strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Auto-save with Steam Cloud</strong> \u2013 pause and continue anytime.<br>\u2714 <strong>Over 10 hours of content</strong>: Become a true artist as you reveal stunning paintings by solving relaxing and immersive puzzles. Unlock over 80 achievements and complete your collection!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mewseum: Masterpieces</strong> is a relaxing game where you can solve hundreds of puzzles while revealing unique masterpieces. Unwind to the sound of a beautiful piano with classical music or listen to your own favorite audio while playing. The puzzles range from easy to medium difficulty, ensuring a smooth and frustration-free experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde9How to Play:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is to paint squares and/or rectangles within the grid while following two simple rules:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each painted section must contain exactly one number.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number indicates the exact size of the section you need to paint.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa8<strong>Explore Art History\u2026 with Cats!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417690/extras/bcf2d91ed8419b0d675cea1c618d8aec.poster.avif?t=1752325862\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417690/extras/bcf2d91ed8419b0d675cea1c618d8aec.webm?t=1752325862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover reimagined versions of iconic paintings, where cats take center stage in some of the most famous artworks in history. The featured paintings include:<br>\ud83e\uddaa<i>Girl with a Pearl Earring</i><br>\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83c\udfa8<i>Mona Lisa</i><br>\ud83d\ude40<i>The Scream</i><br>\u2728<i>Starry Night</i><br>\ud83c\udfe1<i>American Gothic</i><br>\ud83e\uddb5<i>Abaporu</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc6b<i>Arnolfini Portrait</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc67\u200d\ud83d\udc67<i>Las Meninas</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae<strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Auto-save with Steam Cloud</strong> \u2013 pause and continue anytime.<br>\u2714 <strong>Over 10 hours of content</strong>: Become a true artist as you reveal stunning paintings by solving relaxing and immersive puzzles. Unlock over 80 achievements and complete your collection!</p>",
    "short_description": "Mewseum: Masterpieces is a shikaku-style puzzle game where each solved grid reveals part of a great masterpiece. Solve hundreds of puzzles and discover unique paintings in the latest art exhibition of the feline world!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cMewseum Masterpieces is a very relaxing puzzle game with the addition of cats replacing famous people in renowned pieces of artwork, which looks very cute.\u201d<br>IndieGems<br><br>\u201cA purrfect blend of art and puzzles, this feline-themed game offers a serene experience filled with classical music with hundreds of satisfying challenges to reveal iconic paintings.\u201d<br>Puzzle Lovers<br><br>\u201cMewseum: Masterpieces is a charming and tranquil puzzle game designed for players seeking a relaxing experience. The gameplay invites you to solve a variety of visually engaging puzzles that showcase artistic masterpieces.\u201d<br>\ud83d\udc4d \u2013 Ladies Gamers<br>",
